WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.156
Welcome to this seller university module.

00:00:02.156 --> 00:00:09.344
In this video, we'll discuss what to do if you encounter error code 5885 when trying to add or edit

00:00:09.344 --> 00:00:11.500
a product in the Amazon store.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:18.552
Error code 5885 means you cannot change a product detail page, add offers on another seller's generic

00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:22.700
product or copy the product detail page to another store.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:29.300
To resolve this, we recommend creating a new product listing for a generic unbranded product.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:35.550
If you believe you are complying with Amazon's policies, you can contact selling partner support

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:39.300
by navigating to help, then get help and resources.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:45.911
Select adding a product followed by received an error code or message and then select your error

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:46.300
code.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:52.675
If you're using an inventory file template, provide the Batch ID of the processing report in addition

00:00:52.675 --> 00:00:53.800
to the ASIN.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:59.800
If you're using Batch IDs for feeds, be sure to add one ASIN in the top field.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:04.300
A member of Selling Partner Support will reach out if next steps are necessary.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:08.300
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store!
